      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed experiences with floor staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customer feedback regarding store employees reflects contrasting experiences. Several shoppers praise individual staff members, such as groomer Joan and floor associates, for friendly recommendations and attentive customer service. Conversely, other reviewers report encountering unhelpful or scarce personnel on the sales floor, citing difficulties finding assistance during peak shopping hours."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Good selection alongside parking issues"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While reviewers appreciate the wide variety of pet food, litter, and supplies in the store, the location garners mixed opinions. Shoppers note clean aisles and convenient stock, but multiple customers voice strong frustration with the attached parking garage fees, noting that paid parking creates an unwelcome hassle even for quick online order pickups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Perks savings beside higher shelf tags"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Perceptions of pricing vary widely among reviewers. Regular customers note that utilizing Petco Perks rewards, app sales, and online price matching yields solid savings on daily essentials. However, walk-in shoppers frequently describe standard shelf prices as steep compared to alternative retail stores, specifically citing higher costs for litter, toys, and treats."
      }
    }
  ],
